@provenance One of two CANDIDATE RATIONAL RECONSTRUCTIONS of the cleaner (Joe's frame, 2026-09-15: authored once, deterministic thereafter; per-run variation is data). Wiring = ARG CHOICES over the same node library, not different code.

! conclusion:
  Eligibility: every cleaner category (stream http temp dired render
  invoke file-stale); file stale-age 6h (21600s).

  + ARGS: {eligible-kinds #{stream http temp dired render invoke
    file-stale} file-stale-age-seconds 21600} — values from the worked
    example (futon2 a508aa24); the lab's wirings/aggressive.edn is the
    machine projection.

  + BECAUSE: the wiring difference is a data difference — the
    authored-panel thesis: same chips, different args.
